{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Zellige: The Tilemaker of Granada",
    "steam_appid": 2100390,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2100390/extras/0f2e7ae168a1f5d4ba1470e414af3dd5.poster.avif?t=1734117201\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2100390/extras/0f2e7ae168a1f5d4ba1470e414af3dd5.webm?t=1734117201\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2100390/extras/0f2e7ae168a1f5d4ba1470e414af3dd5.mp4?t=1734117201\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Zellige : The Tilemaker of Granada is a meditative and relaxing historical game, set in medieval Al-Andalus, where you play as a skilled tilemaker and design intricate Islamic mosaic patterns to decorate a merchant family's palace.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2100390/extras/6ce8636ab7fe04dccb613ac619723b26.avif?t=1734117201\" /></div><br><br>You will be able to create a various array of mosaics in all styles, following traditional techniques or let your creativity flow !<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2100390/extras/f48641d93973adc92da65cb07a0e8dbd.avif?t=1734117201\" /></div><br><br>We really aim to bring you a calm experience, the sort of game you can play to unwind after a long day at work, and to get that sense of satisfaction that comes with creating something of your own. The palace is a fully explorable 3D environment, which you can walk around and admire in first-person. While doing so, you'll be able to talk to its inhabitants, the Dhahbans. They are a wealthy, well-travelled merchant family, and their home is filled with souvenirs and artefacts from across the Islamic world which will help you find inspiration and learn new techniques!",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2100390/extras/0f2e7ae168a1f5d4ba1470e414af3dd5.poster.avif?t=1734117201\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2100390/extras/0f2e7ae168a1f5d4ba1470e414af3dd5.webm?t=1734117201\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2100390/extras/0f2e7ae168a1f5d4ba1470e414af3dd5.mp4?t=1734117201\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Zellige : The Tilemaker of Granada is a meditative and relaxing historical game, set in medieval Al-Andalus, where you play as a skilled tilemaker and design intricate Islamic mosaic patterns to decorate a merchant family's palace.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2100390/extras/6ce8636ab7fe04dccb613ac619723b26.avif?t=1734117201\" /></div><br><br>You will be able to create a various array of mosaics in all styles, following traditional techniques or let your creativity flow !<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2100390/extras/f48641d93973adc92da65cb07a0e8dbd.avif?t=1734117201\" /></div><br><br>We really aim to bring you a calm experience, the sort of game you can play to unwind after a long day at work, and to get that sense of satisfaction that comes with creating something of your own. The palace is a fully explorable 3D environment, which you can walk around and admire in first-person. While doing so, you'll be able to talk to its inhabitants, the Dhahbans. They are a wealthy, well-travelled merchant family, and their home is filled with souvenirs and artefacts from across the Islamic world which will help you find inspiration and learn new techniques!",
    "short_description": "Zellige : The Tilemaker of Granada is a meditative and relaxing historical game, set in medieval Al-Andalus, where you play as a skilled tilemaker and design intricate Islamic mosaic patterns to decorate a merchant family's palace. Let your creativity flow and create beautiful patterns !",
